    <string name="setup_mic_title">Microphone</string>
    <string name="setup_mic_body">HMT Vocale needs the microphone to hear your commands.\n\n• Push-to-talk: the microphone is used only while you press the button.\n• Hands-free \"Geely\" (experimental): the app listens in the background for the word \"Geely\". Android shows a permanent notification while this is active. Depending on the speech service installed on your tablet, audio may be processed online and a short beep may play.\n\nYou can turn hands-free listening off at any time in Settings.</string>
