    <string name="commands_list">• Open apps: YouTube, Spotify, Deezer, Anghami, Waze, Google Maps, Chrome, WhatsApp, Music, Settings\n• Navigation: \"Take me to Oran\"\n• Media: play, pause, next, previous\n• Volume: up, down, mute, \"volume 50\"\n• Questions: who created this app, what time is it, help\n• Language: \"Speak French / English / Arabic\"\n• Vehicle (simulation or not supported yet): air conditioning, temperature, fan, windows</string>
